msgid "Open _Files…"
msgstr "_Dosya Aç…"

#. translators: button label that opens the folder picker. Please underline a different character than the one in the Open Files button
msgid "Open F_olders…"
msgstr "_Klasör Aç…"

#. translators: generic error message shown when the cleaning
#. was unsuccessful but we don't know why
msgid "An error occurred during the cleaning."
msgstr "Temizleme sırasında hata oluştu."

#. translators: error message when a file is no longer
#. available during cleaning. "Something
#. bad happened" as in "Something went
#. wrong"
msgid "Something bad happened during the cleaning, cleaned file not found"
msgstr "Temizleme sırasında kötü bir şey oldu, temizlenen dosya bulunamadı"

